  "body": "Two homes, one smart purchase! Here is an exceptional opportunity in the heart of Bucklands Beach. Proudly positioned on a 759m2 freehold site, this legal home-and-income property offers outstanding versatility for families, extended families, investors and developers alike. \r\n\r\nUpstairs of the main residence features four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including an ensuite, with spacious open-plan living and dining areas that flow seamlessly through to a sunroom and sun-drenched balconies. These inviting spaces provide the perfect setting for relaxed family living and effortless entertaining. \r\n\r\nDownstairs, there is a self-contained area with a separate entry, comprising a living room, bedroom, bathroom and laundry, providing excellent flexibility for extended family, guests, teenagers or additional accommodation. The majority of the windows in the main home have been upgraded to double glazing. CCTV with four cameras covers all four corners of the house, while a water filtration system, combined with the HRV system, helps maintain a warm, dry and comfortable living environment all year round.\r\n\r\nAdding even more value, the second dwelling offers two bedrooms, one bathroom and a study, making it ideal for extended family or those looking to strengthen their rental portfolio. With separate power meters for each dwelling, this property provides the potential for two independent income streams from one smart investment.\r\n \r\nThere are plenty of on-site car parking spaces, along with generous off-street parking, while a sunny, low-maintenance yard completes this highly appealing package. Zoned Mixed Housing Suburban, the property also presents exciting potential for future development, subject to Auckland Council approval. Whether you're looking to live, invest or explore future development possibilities, the options are plentiful.\r\n\r\nLocation is another major highlight as it sits within a few minutes' walk of Pigeon Mountain Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College - perfectly positioned in one of East Auckland's most sought-after areas. \r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of the local lifestyle with easy access to public transport, shops and amenities, while nearby Bucklands Beach, Eastern Beach and Half Moon Bay Marina offer beautiful beaches, cafes, restaurants and ferry connections to Waiheke Island.\r\n \r\nOur cherished vendors have lovingly called this home for over a decade, creating a lifetime of wonderful memories along the way. Now, with plans to relocate and begin a new chapter, they are genuinely committed to selling. This property will be sold at auction or prior, so don't miss your opportunity to secure this versatile home-and-income property in a premium Bucklands Beach location.\r\n\r\n* Find more properties you may like at - https://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
